 *   occluders        bumpers and triggers drawn BEHIND the body, peeking above
 *                    the crown. Occlusion is the strongest depth cue there is.
 *   edge slab        the same path again at translate(0,6) in a dark gradient:
 *                    that band IS the thickness of the shell.
